{"s":107,"name":"سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ","en_name":"Al-Maa'un","ar":["أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","فَوَيْلٌۭ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ","ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَآءُونَ","وَيَمْنَعُونَ ٱلْمَاعُونَ"],"en":["Hast thou observed him who belieth religion?","That is he who repelleth the orphan,","And urgeth not the feeding of the needy.","Ah, woe unto worshippers","Who are heedless of their prayer;","Who would be seen (at worship)","Yet refuse small kindnesses!"],"src":"api.alquran.cloud quran-uthmani + en.pickthall","lw":[[2,24,25,8,38],[20,28,24,4,17],[27,16,25,5,20],[20,23,25,2,11],[1,14,25,5,20],[1,24,25,3,13],[27,25,25,2,14]],"lw_src":"Quran Recorder wardrobe.js + quran-text.js @6bac659"}